  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You plan just the right sabotage for later. As a full-round action, you can reveal a plan to be the sabotage of an object you could access when you last prepared plans.</p>\n<p>It can be any application of the Disable Device skill or a (sabotage) talent. You attempt the Disable Device check when you reveal the plan, but you can take 10 on it even in combat. You can trigger the sabotage as part of the action to reveal this plan.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
